      "id": "english-poetry-anthology-s0012-p00030",
      "source_en": "Indicating to each one what he shall have, giving something to each;\nBut what I drew from the water by the pond-side, that I reserve,\nI will give of it, but only to them that love as I myself am capable of loving.",
